md='# Eight Pinterest Pins · November 2026\n\nEight independent 1000 × 1500 PNGs. English (US). Prepared for manual publication only. Link each Pin to its own destination below; do not replace these with a home-page link. Public campaign labels are allowlisted in consent-gated GA4. These are campaign assets, not evidence of search volume or future traffic.\n\n'
for p in pins:
 md+=f"## {p['id']} · {p['title']}\n\n**File:** [{p['filename']}]({p['filename']})\n\n**Title:** {p['title']}\n\n**Description:** {p['description']}\n\n**Alt text:** {p['alt']}\n\n**Destination:** [{p['path']}]({p['destination']})\n\n**Target keywords:** {', '.join(p['keywords'])}\n\n"
md+='## Publication notes\n\nKeep relevant visual/affiliate disclosures in descriptions. Do not imply manufacturer endorsement, physical testing, universal compatibility or guaranteed savings. The cost Pin is a worked example, not a typical market result. Use Pinterest’s applicable synthetic-content disclosure settings for the original illustrative scenes. Check each native mobile preview before publishing. No Pins were uploaded automatically.\n'
(HERE/'PINTEREST-PUBLISH.md').write_text(md,encoding='utf8')
